## 7. Prohibited Actions

| # | Action | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Store payment card/UPI data locally | PCI violation |
| 2 | Expose Supabase service_role key to iOS | Security breach |
| 3 | Perform Razorpay verification on device | Payment fraud risk |
| 4 | Disable RLS for convenience | Data exposure |
| 5 | Force unwrap Optionals (`!`) without checks | App crashes |
| 6 | Hardcode API keys in Swift files | Use Xcode Configurations |
| 7 | Put network logic in SwiftUI Views | Violates MVVM |
| 8 | Build features not in PRD v2.0 | Scope creep |
| 9 | Heavy computation on Main Thread | Freezes UI |
| 10 | Skip error alerts for user actions | Confuses user |
| 11 | Modify v1.0 context files | Version integrity |
| 12 | Drop existing database columns | Data loss risk |
| 13 | Skip TDD for new features | Quality regression |
| 14 | Store AI API keys in iOS app | Security breach |
| 15 | Allow unverified campaigns on marketplace | Trust violation |
